 the county&rsquo;s 5 grids, August to September came in under 90% of normal in 40 of those years, more than any other pair of months. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 152% of normal in April to May and just 46% in November to December. Every grid had its driest year in 1965, with grid 23317 at 65% that year.</p>"}
